+
+Platform Strategy: ${platformGuidance}
+Target Aspect Ratio: ${aspectRatio}
+Desired Pacing: ${pacing}
+Source Type: ${sourceType || 'text'} ${fileName ? `(File: ${fileName})` : ''}
+
+Break down the story into 3 to 6 compelling scenes:
+- Each scene must have a very punchy on-screen caption (under 10 words, easy to read on mobile).
+- Each scene must have natural spoken voiceover narration (10-25 words).
+- Scene duration between 2.2 and 4.2 seconds.
+- Suggest transition types: "zoom_in", "zoom_out", "glitch", "whip_pan", "flash", "slide_left", "fade".
+- Specify focalPoint { x: 0.0 - 1.0, y: 0.0 - 1.0 } for smart vertical cropping.
+- Provide a zoomScale (between 1.05 and 1.25) for Ken Burns dynamic motion.
+- Provide custom viral captions & trending hashtags for TikTok, Shorts, and Reels.`;
